Subject: Cantor Read Only Live Codex Transport Hardening Source

& [SourceIdentity] is post-proof resource-boundary evidence
  + [source_uuid] is a8f3fac2-11a0-4307-8f98-5f158b63a155
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 2ae1df49-9a3d-41b3-b6ea-a223626d2d49
